      "message": "Note that we\u0027re not considering the layer\u0027s color space here, but I *think* that\u0027s okay, if we assume that any restore-filtering should be in the original device\u0027s color space? (Because this code path is logically equivalent to \"no rendering happens in the layer, the DAG is evaluated as part of the restore\". Is that right, @michaelludwig@google.com?)",
